Scarcely twenty in human years and fresh off a farm, Argyle is nonetheless a licensed doctor — one of those facts that sits strangely beside another: their eyes are mid-shift from gold to a bright, almost bluish white. They are the child of [[Aaron Cross]] and [[Joran Davinrock]], both operatives of the [[Scale]], and carry the unusual distinction of knowing every member of that organisation by name.
